\f2\i Aerial view of the compound crumbling in on itself and into a hole in the ground that grows, consuming the car park other buildings, trees, a helicopter trying to make a desperate escape. The hole widens and consumes the surrounding landscape then swiftly sucks the entire planet into a black hole. It widens and widens, one of the spiral arms of the milky way slows down and begins to swirl and spins into the ever widening expanse. Other spiral arms are knocked out of orbit, crash into one another and spin   into the black hole. The gravity shift causes the super giant black hole at the centre of the milky way to consume the inner spiral arms until there are just two black holes that move together and form as one.
